## 2. Module 1 Deep-Dive — Data Integration & Connectivity

### 2.1 Palantir Benchmark: "Data Connection" Application

Palantir's approach to data integration is not a traditional ETL tool. Their Data Connection application provides connectivity between Foundry and external systems (citation:10), with native connectors for all types of data and metadata flows — whether batch, streaming, or event-driven (citation:7). The key differentiator is that Foundry provides a "highly configurable set of data connectivity and integration tools that extend far beyond typical extract-transform-load (ETL)" (citation:8).

