| CDC latency (source commit → platform availability) | < 10 sec | < 5 sec | Debezium + Kafka consumer with 1-sec poll interval |
| Streaming throughput (Kafka, 1KB events) | ~500K events/sec | 500K events/sec | Consumer group with 32 partitions, batch commit |
