## 3. Module 2 Deep-Dive — Pipeline Engine & Spark Orchestration

### 3.1 Palantir Benchmark: Spark-Powered Transformations

Spark is the distributed computing system used within Foundry to run data transformations at scale (citation:17). All scheduled pipeline workflows are fully version-controlled (citation:18). Palantir's pipeline system is not just an orchestrator — it is a **code-aware, lineage-generating, version-controlled transformation engine**.

