**TRANSFORM: Join**

```python
@transform(
    left=Input("customers"),
    right=Input("orders"),
    output=Output("customer_orders")
)
def join_datasets(ctx, left, right, output):
    left_df = left.dataframe()
    right_df = right.dataframe()
    joined = left_df.join(
        right_df,
        on=left_df["customer_id"] == right_df["cust_id"],
        how="left"
    )
    output.write_dataframe(joined)
```

