## 7. Module 6 Deep-Dive — AIP (Agent + LLM + Governance)

### 7.1 Palantir Benchmark: AIP Architecture

Palantir's AIP integrates LLMs with data analytics and operations (citation:22). The approach is "driven by realism" — Palantir focuses on building "an AI Operating System that allows an organization to actually use AI/ML models as part of an ecosystem of value creation" (citation:23). AIP allows organizations to "run LLMs and other models on your private network with full control" (citation:21).

### 7.2 AIP Agent Architecture (Deep Specification)

```
