### 7.3 ML Ops Deep Specification (Modeling Objectives)

Palantir's ML Ops focuses on the "Modeling Objective" — "the critical link between a model's creation and operational use" (citation:23). Models must be "treated as an input to a process that has an understanding of the different operational objectives that a model might be used for" (citation:23).

