## 9. Module 8 Deep-Dive — Security, Governance & PETs

### 9.1 Palantir Benchmark: Operational Security & Privacy-Enhancing Technologies

Palantir treats security as a cross-cutting concern spanning every layer. Their approach to privacy-enhancing technologies (PETs) and operational security is a key differentiator in regulated industries (citation:25).

### 9.2 Multi-Layer Security Model

